    "reasoning_cat1": "'raw-exclusive' is plainly a garbled 'non-exclusive,' a mechanical error going to the scope of the licence back; 'any product that contains Material' and 'inventions that arise from the use of the Materials' are both undefined at the edges and drive the whole commercialisation question. Multiple nameable textual defects.",
