    "reasoning_cat2": "It sits comfortably with paragraph 9's warranty disclaimer and paragraph 4's storage-and-disposal duties, and nothing elsewhere allocates risk differently. No competing provision found.",
    "prob_cat1": 0.13,
    "prob_cat2": 0.08
  },
  {
    "clause_id": "c012",
    "reasoning_cat1": "A signature instruction with no substantive content beyond identifying who must countersign; 'authorized official' is the only term with any edge. Essentially nothing to construe.",
    "reasoning_cat2": "It is consistent with the preamble's identification of Recipient Scientist and Recipient and with the signature block; the only possible question is whether the Recipient institution's official actually signed. That is a factual, not a construction, issue.",
